 "input": "how our journal handles a submission. author submits through the manuscript system. editorial assistant checks formatting and runs the plagiarism check. handling editor reads it, can desk-reject straight away. otherwise invites 2-3 reviewers from the reviewer database, they get 3 weeks, reviewer reports come back into the manuscript system. editor writes the decision letter based on the reports: accept, minor, major, reject. revisions go back to the same reviewers usually. accepted papers go to production: copyediting, typesetting, author proofs, then online first. APC invoice is sent at acceptance by the finance office.",
